# Build output. `cargo build` alone fills this with gigabytes of
# dependencies and incremental state, all of it reproducible from Cargo.toml.
/target/

# Rustfmt backups and MSVC debug symbols.
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Remembered recipients. The history normally lives in
# $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/payme-qr/, but --contacts can put it anywhere; it holds
# real names and bank account numbers and must never reach the repository.
contacts.yml
contacts.yaml

# QR codes written into the working directory: the names the form saves under
# by default, and the ones the README examples use.
/payme.png
/payme.svg
/invoice.png
/donate.svg

# IDE and editor state. The whole .idea directory is local to this machine;
# drop this line if you ever want to share the project configuration.
/.idea/
/.vscode/
*.iml
*.swp
*~

# OS clutter.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
